Canvas need fixed container behind UI. [scene.ts](file:///home/gaitano/01-studio/01-src/eugene-gaitano/frontend/src/scene.ts#L7-L95) export `init(container)`. Call inside React `useEffect`.

### 1. Make background component

Create `frontend/src/components/BackgroundScene.tsx`:

```tsx
import { useEffect, useRef } from "react";
import { init } from "../scene";

export default function BackgroundScene() {
  const containerRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);

  useEffect(() => {
    if (!containerRef.current) return;
    const cleanup = init(containerRef.current);
    return () => cleanup();
  }, []);

  return (
    <div
      ref={containerRef}
      style={{
        position: "fixed",
        top: 0,
        left: 0,
        width: "100vw",
        height: "100vh",
        zIndex: -1,
        pointerEvents: "none",
        overflow: "hidden",
      }}
    />
  );
}
```

> [!NOTE]
> `pointerEvents: "none"` allow clicks pass to page buttons. `OrbitControls` drag stop working, but `window.mousemove` shader uniform still track. If drag needed, change `pointerEvents` to `"auto"` and move interactive UI into relative container with higher `z-index`.

---

### 2. Mount in App

Edit [App.tsx](file:///home/gaitano/01-studio/01-src/eugene-gaitano/frontend/src/App.tsx):

```tsx
import { BrowserRouter, Route, Routes } from "react-router-dom";
import BackgroundScene from "./components/BackgroundScene";
import Home from "./pages/Home";
import Resume from "./pages/Resume";

function App() {
  return (
    <>
      <BackgroundScene />
      <BrowserRouter>
        <Routes>
          <Route path="/" element={<Home />} />
          <Route path="/resume" element={<Resume />} />
        </Routes>
      </BrowserRouter>
    </>
  );
}

export default App;
```

---

### 3. Check CSS body transparency

Body background hide canvas if opaque. Update [index.css](file:///home/gaitano/01-studio/01-src/eugene-gaitano/frontend/src/index.css#L23-L28):

```css
body {
  font-family: "Space Grotesk";
  font-weight: 500;
  background-color: transparent;
  color: var(--black);
}
```

Canvas mount behind. Render loop run. UI stay on top.

